---
import FAQHeader from "./FAQHeader.astro";
import FAQCategory from "./FAQCategory.astro";
import FAQItem from "./FAQItem.astro";
import FAQCTA from "./FAQCTA.astro";
---

<section class="faq" id="faq">

	<div class="container">

		<FAQHeader />

		<FAQCategory title="Discord">

			<FAQItem
				icon="🛠️"
				question={{
					es: "¿Qué incluye el servicio de servidores de Discord?",
					en: "What does the Discord server service include?",
				}}
			>
				<p data-lang="es">
					Creamos servidores desde cero, configuramos servidores
					existentes (bots, roles, canales, moderación) o los
					rediseñamos por completo con nueva identidad visual.
				</p>

				<p data-lang="en">
					We create servers from scratch, configure existing
					servers (bots, roles, channels, moderation) or fully
					redesign them with a new visual identity.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="📋"
				question={{
					es: "¿Cómo funciona el cuestionario?",
					en: "How does the questionnaire work?",
				}}
			>
				<p data-lang="es">
					Rellenas un formulario contándonos el propósito, el
					estilo, la estructura y las funciones que necesitas.
					Con esa información preparamos una propuesta a tu medida.
				</p>

				<p data-lang="en">
					You fill out a form telling us the purpose, style,
					structure and features you need. With that information
					we prepare a proposal tailored to you.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="⏱️"
				question={{
					es: "¿Cuánto tarda el proceso?",
					en: "How long does the process take?",
				}}
			>
				<p data-lang="es">
					El tiempo depende de la complejidad del servidor. Tras
					recibir tu cuestionario te contactaremos para confirmar
					el plazo antes de empezar.
				</p>

				<p data-lang="en">
					Timing depends on the complexity of the server. After
					receiving your questionnaire we'll reach out to confirm
					the timeline before starting.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="💸"
				question={{
					es: "¿Cuánto cuesta el servicio?",
					en: "How much does the service cost?",
				}}
			>
				<p data-lang="es">
					Nada. Nuestros servicios de creación, configuración y
					rediseño de servidores de Discord son 100% gratuitos,
					sin coste oculto ni letra pequeña.
				</p>

				<p data-lang="en">
					Nothing. Our Discord server creation, configuration and
					redesign services are 100% free, with no hidden costs
					or fine print.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="🤖"
				question={{
					es: "¿Qué bots recomendáis para mi servidor?",
					en: "Which bots do you recommend for my server?",
				}}
			>
				<p data-lang="es">
					Depende de lo que necesites, pero solemos recomendar
					bots gratuitos y fiables como <strong>Carl-bot</strong>
					(roles por reacción, embeds y moderación), <strong>Dyno</strong>
					(moderación y automod) o <strong>ProBot</strong>
					(bienvenidas y niveles). Te ayudamos a elegir e instalar
					los adecuados durante la configuración de tu servidor.
				</p>

				<p data-lang="en">
					It depends on what you need, but we usually recommend
					reliable free bots like <strong>Carl-bot</strong>
					(reaction roles, embeds and moderation), <strong>Dyno</strong>
					(moderation and automod) or <strong>ProBot</strong>
					(welcome messages and leveling). We help you choose and
					install the right ones while setting up your server.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

		</FAQCategory>


		<FAQCategory title="General">

			<FAQItem
				icon="🚀"
				question="What is SpectroDinner™?"
			>
				<p>
					SpectroDinner™ is an independent software and
					game development studio focused on creating
					digital products, interactive experiences and
					innovative technologies.
				</p>

				<p>
					The studio combines software engineering,
					game development and experimental technologies
					to build solutions designed with performance,
					quality and long-term maintainability in mind.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="👤"
				question="Who is behind SpectroDinner™?"
			>
				<p>
					SpectroDinner™ was founded and is led by
					Elmoderador, Founder, CEO & Lead Developer.
				</p>

				<p>
					He is responsible for the studio's vision,
					software architecture and development process,
					ensuring every project follows the same quality
					standards and long-term philosophy.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="📅"
				question="When was SpectroDinner™ founded?"
			>
				<p>
					SpectroDinner™ was founded in 2024 with the
					objective of creating software, games and
					technology projects while continuously
					improving development practices.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

		</FAQCategory>



		<FAQCategory title="Projects">

			<FAQItem
				icon="🎮"
				question="What kind of projects does SpectroDinner™ create?"
			>
				<p>
					The studio develops software applications,
					video games, Minecraft plugins, developer
					tools and experimental technologies.
				</p>

				<p>
					Every project follows the same principles:
					performance, maintainability, clean
					architecture and long-term support whenever
					possible.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="⛏️"
				question="What is TimeEconomyPlugin?"
			>
				<p>
					TimeEconomyPlugin is one of
					SpectroDinner™'s featured projects.
				</p>

				<p>
					It is a large-scale Minecraft plugin built
					using Java and the Paper API, focused on
					custom gameplay mechanics, progression
					systems and advanced server features.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="🌐"
				question="Are your projects open source?"
			>
				<p>
					Some projects are publicly available through
					GitHub, while others remain private until
					they reach a stable release.
				</p>

				<p>
					Public repositories are intended to encourage
					learning, collaboration and transparency
					within the developer community.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

		</FAQCategory>



		<FAQCategory title="Development">

			<FAQItem
				icon="🛠️"
				question="What technologies does SpectroDinner™ use?"
			>
				<p>
					Technology depends on each project's needs.
					Commonly used languages include Java,
					TypeScript, JavaScript, Python and C++.
				</p>

				<p>
					Modern development workflows, Git,
					documentation and quality standards are part
					of every project.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

			<FAQItem
				icon="🤝"
				question="Can I collaborate with SpectroDinner™?"
			>
				<p>
					Collaboration opportunities may become
					available depending on the project's
					requirements.
				</p>

				<p>
					The best way to stay informed is through our
					official GitHub repositories and future
					development updates.
				</p>
			</FAQItem>

		</FAQCategory>

		<FAQCTA />

	</div>

</section>

<style>

.faq {

	padding:120px 32px;

}

.container {

	max-width:1100px;

	margin:auto;

	display:flex;

	flex-direction:column;

	gap:70px;

}

@media (max-width:768px) {

	.faq {

		padding:90px 20px;

	}

	.container {

		gap:50px;

	}

}

</style>